  "assessmentPrinciples": "Record observable facts, identify the traditional guideline used, explain practical implications, prioritise recommendations and disclose uncertainty. Structural, electrical, plumbing and other technical matters must be referred to qualified professionals. **No directional placement, colour or remedy is described as guaranteeing health, wealth, relationship or career outcomes.**",
  "readinessCheck": "Answer honestly: Can I read a simple diagram? Do I have a notebook? Am I willing to separate tradition from safety and practicality? Am I ready to practise on hypothetical plans? If yes to all, begin Day 1."
