  "timeNote": "**How the time works.** The 90-minute guided session is unchanged. The sections marked **\"Go deeper\"**, **Real-World Case Study B**, the **Mini-cases** and **Extra Practice** are **self-study / optional extensions**: read them before or after the live session, at your own pace (about 60-90 extra minutes in total). You do not need them to complete the graded practical, but they will make your first assessments far more confident.",
  "learningQuestion": "\"Before I say anything about a home, what do I need to know, and how do I say it responsibly?\"",
