      "task": "**Exercise 1 — Rewrite the verdict.** *What to do:* Rewrite each of these statements as a neutral F-I-R entry or as a correctly tagged observation: (a) \"This plot has a bad shape.\" (b) \"The water tank is in the wrong place, so the house will have problems.\" (c) \"The garden is excellent.\"",
