          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "**Key idea:** a room's position may matter less to everyday function than its **relationship with adjacent spaces, openings and services.** When you find a conflict, try **low-disruption options first**: door re-hanging, screens or curtains, furniture rearrangement, lighting and ventilation improvements, changing the *use* of a room. Structural change comes last and only through qualified professionals."
