    "Mark the reasoning, the stated framework and the safety priority, not the number of \"differences\" found.",
    "Reinforce the label line: schools differ; interpretive preferences, not engineering facts; no outcome claims.",
    "Remind learners: a Vastu assessment does not replace structural, plumbing, electrical or gas professionals.",
