                                          "The east-facing cook and south-east kitchen match commonly taught guidance. The inadequate clearance beside combustible materials, the curtain near flame, and the enclosed cylinder are safety concerns.",
                                          "Safety and required clearances take priority over any preferred direction. The layout must be revised.",
                                          "The appliance manufacturer\u0027s instructions, a licensed gas fitter and a licensed electrician; a ventilation/chimney installer for the duct route; the designer or contractor for the revised layout.",
