  "timeNote": "**How the time works in this expanded edition.** The guided session stays at **90 minutes** and follows the Daily Rhythm in Section 2. The sections marked **\"Go deeper\"**, **Real-World Case Study B**, **Mini-cases** and **Extra Practice** are **self-study / optional extension** material: read them before or after the session, at your own pace. They are not needed to finish the 90-minute session or to complete the graded assignment, but they will make the lessons much easier to apply."
