  "☐ Record the room's zone as a fact; add the commonly taught preference as an interpretation, naming the framework.",
  "☐ Write \"schools differ\" and \"deviation is not a defect\" wherever a room lies away from a preference.",
  "☐ Check access on each side of the bed and the clear night route to the bathroom.",
  "☐ Open the door and wardrobe doors fully; note any conflict with the bed.",
  "☐ Check tall furniture is anchored and nothing heavy sits above the bed.",
