                          "answer":  "*Short answer:* F: the fan runs but airflow is weak; the duct appears to end inside the ceiling void. I: ventilation likely ineffective; moisture may be trapped, Category 1 (maintenance). R: ask a technician to check the fan and extend the duct to the outdoors. A running fan is not the same as an effective one."
