                              "task":  "**Exercise 2: Sort and order.** Sort these into categories and write the report order: (i) toilet in the south; (ii) tap drips constantly; (iii) the family does not know where the septic tank is; (iv) door opens directly onto the dining table; (v) switch with a cracked cover beside the shower.",
