                          "answer":  "*Short answer:* Record the door swing, the 40 cm gap (approximate) and the blocked route as facts. Priority is safety and function: turn the sofa or move it so the door opens fully and a clear route remains; document the sofa\u0027s position under the named framework as a secondary matter."
