                          "answer":  "*Short answer:* Verify light level, glare, noise and seat height, and the kitchen extraction, before discussing position. Respond with a task lamp, extraction use or a window opened, quiet cooking time or a move to another surface during cooking. Record the table\u0027s position as a fact and name the framework; do not call it wrong."
