                              "answer":  "*What a good answer contains:* A ranking with reasons, and an acknowledgement that rank depends on date and purpose. A sample: taped measurement today (limitation: only the rooms you can access, measurement error), approved drawing (may not match what was built), brochure plan (illustrative, may be marketing), memory sketch (unverified). Any ordering that is justified and notes that conflicts are recorded rather than resolved by rank is acceptable."
